g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"replay\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe id-probe · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">const LENGTH: u32 = 1000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">const INPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">const OUTPUT_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"4\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const INPUT_B_OFFSET: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; inputBValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"7\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; outputValues: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"8\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"9\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3u,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">  let workgroupIndex = (workgroupId.z * 1u + workgroupId.y) * 4u + workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  if (index &gt;= LENGTH) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">  let a = inputValues[INPUT_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">  let b = inputBValues[INPUT_B_OFFSET + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  outputValues[OUTPUT_OFFSET + index] = a + b;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>inputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"rainfall\">rainfall</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>inputBValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"prevDayRainfall\">prevDayRainfall</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>outputValues<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"twoDayRainfall\">twoDayRainfall</td><td>write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUElementwise/add · main · 4e21b44a</figcaption></figure></section>",
